#### [The Resonance Cradle](get_cradle)
---
Scope: shared
State: secret
When: signal beacon_cradle
---
The pieces are useless loose - they need the CRADLE to seat and resonate them, and Crazy Eddy
fenced the only one left. Buy the Resonance Cradle from Eddy - hail him on the Ultra-Beam, or
better, drop by his Emporium and buy it in person. Do it any time before the finale; the
Beacon can't be lit without it.

#### [Crazy Eddy's Emporium](visit_emporium)
---
Scope: shared
State: secret
When: reach 3, 3
---
Eddy runs his whole racket out of the Spaceship Emporium, a ramshackle bazaar at (3, 3).
Engage and jump there to see his stock in person - hail the station to browse the deals.

#### [Storm's Fourth Lead](ep4_go)
---
Scope: shared
State: secret
When: reach -5, -4
Then: reveal beacon_arc/ep4_approach
---
That votive plate was worth the wasted trip. The people who built the Choir were watching
when the real relay was broken up, and they wrote down where the pieces went: the HEART,
the Beacon's power source, hauled out to a dead salvage yard at (-5, -4). XORN has been
cutting at it ever since. You will have to pry it loose from under their guns. Engage, and
be ready to run.

#### [The Heart](ep4_scan)
---
Scope: shared
State: secret
When: signal heart_taken
Pays: 300 credits
---
Not a ruin - a kill-yard. XORN dragged the Beacon's HEART, its power source, out to this
gutted salvage field and left a heavy screen on it: wrecks, mines, and a wing that answers to
no flag but its own.

## Objective
- Fly the cut - XORN made the hole, so use it
- Through the yard and the drum, then down the trench
- Scan the Heart, tether it, and get it out past whatever is still awake

## Hazard
XORN is close here and comes fast. This is the last place to be caught lingering - take the
Heart and RUN. Do not try to hold the field.

And unlike every other ruin on this trail, there is something INSIDE this one: XORN left a
picket in the yard and another in the trench, where there is no room to turn round.

